{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Implemented as commit bb3125f6c9a (local, pre-push). Red first: with JIRA_URL/JIRA_USER/JIRA_API_TOKEN set to placeholders, collect-only of make test's selections AND live collected test_delete_permission_probe and test_bridge_preview_against_live_jira. Green: both make test selections AND live collect 0 of 21138 nodes. Parity found one more gap: macOS's default route 'platform_compat and not external' would select a hypothetical platform_compat+live test that make test no longer selects, so that route now ends 'and not live' (no live test is platform_compat today). 1979 related tests passed, make lint and make typecheck pass. make verify running with Jira vars unset."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793812962102334001,"uuid":"eb9104ee-c769-47c0-bc53-f25fdb68fc80"}